{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284270","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028427001:0":{"text":"なるほど。これがあなたの正体というわけですね。あなたは植物学者などではなかった！","source_cn":"好呀，原来这才是你的真面目，你根本不是植物学家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23C01C5DAC81977A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028427002:0":{"text":"――この悪人め！","source_cn":"——坏人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x135E55DF75DB5A1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028427003:0":{"text":"観念して本当のことを話してください！","source_cn":"先生，你现在可以说实话了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EDBB726B08ADD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028427004:0":{"text":"ぼ、僕はブラックゴールド商会の人間だ……許してくれ！ほら！その植物学者を目覚めさせる解毒剤だ！","source_cn":"我、我是黑金商会的……别动手，给，这是能让那个植物学家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF023DB791FAEA892","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028427005:0":{"text":"こいつの子どもをさらって、僕に協力するように脅迫したんだ……","source_cn":"我带走了他的孩子，胁迫他和我合作……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x942396AD8643E716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1028427005":{"text":"こいつの子どもをさらって、僕に協力するように脅迫したんだ……","source_cn":"我带走了他的孩子，胁迫他和我合作……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x942396AD8643E716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028427006:0":{"text":"子どもは閉じ込めてる……場所を教えるから！頼む！許してくれ！","source_cn":"我把他的孩子关起来了……我会把地方告诉你们！别、别打！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43C0052AC5875C92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028427007:0":{"text":"ここで何をしていたのですか？","source_cn":"你们到底在这里做什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEEEFD55366C34C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028427008:0":{"text":"け、研究をしていた……腐敗の研究だ……","source_cn":"做、做研究……腐化的研究……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE96396D7236B900B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1028427008":{"text":"け、研究をしていた……腐敗の研究だ……","source_cn":"做、做研究……腐化的研究……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE96396D7236B900B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028427009:0":{"text":"そうさ。あんなへんぴな場所に、突然大勢の人間が来るなんて思わなかったんだ……","source_cn":"是我，谁知道那么偏僻的地方，突然来了一队人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2C836A0D58A1B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028427013:0":{"text":"ダメです！こいつは許すわけにはいきません！マスター、いっそのこと、こいつを――","source_cn":"不行！不能放过他！主人，我们干脆把他——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6B48E85425A25379","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ダメです！こいつは許すわけにはいきません！マスター、いっそのこと、こいつを――","female":"ダメです！こいつは許すわけにはいきません！マスター、いっそのこと、こいつを――","variant_male_record_index":"113335","variant_female_record_index":"113336","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028427014:0":{"text":"えっ？や……やめてくれ……ぜ、全部話したじゃないか！助けてくれ！頼む！","source_cn":"哎？别……别别……我、我都说了，都说了啊！救命！求求你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EFBCB35958C0E7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028427015:0":{"text":"――とっ捕まえて、ヴィジランツに突き出しましょう！","source_cn":"——把他绑起来！叫巡游队把他带走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD943611C04229F34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028427016:0":{"text":"フン！ロンロンを怒らせたらタダじゃすまないぞ！","source_cn":"哼！气死满满了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9460F10A82F40B60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028427017:1":{"text":"この男のことはヴィジランツに任せて、私たちは本物の植物学者を助けましょう！","source_cn":"巡游队会给他应有的待遇，我们先把那位真正的植物学家救醒吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2769C0FCB4DD553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"森の腐敗はお前の仕業だな？","source_cn":"林场的腐化是你做的吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCBF65DF1DE8A1F7E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"森の腐敗はお前の仕業だな？","female":"森の腐敗はお前の仕業なのね？","variant_male_record_index":"61880","variant_female_record_index":"61881","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028427010:0":{"text":"研究だよ！森の腐敗の研究の他にも、腐敗の中で生物がどんな状態になるかも研究する必要があるからね……","source_cn":"研究嘛，除了研究森林腐化，当然也要研究当地生物被腐化侵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA15EFECF9603FEFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028427011:0":{"text":"そしたら、ちょうど採集部隊が来やがった……どのみち、たいした症状じゃなかったけどな……","source_cn":"这不刚好那些采集队来了……而且，事实上也没有造成很严重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FFE371EF57D2DFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028427012:0":{"text":"お前！それでも人間か！？","source_cn":"你！你简直毫无人性！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD558D694BC1F215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"採集部隊の病気は……","source_cn":"采集队的病情……","status":"matched_runti